==Finnish==

===Etymology===
{{rfe|lang=fi}}
From Middle Proto-Finnic ''*širv-'', from Baltic ''širw-''. Related to Estonian {{m|et|hirv}}, Veps {{m|vep|hirb'}}.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[elk]], [[moose]] (''[[Alces alces]]'')
# any large deer, such as an elk, moose or [[wapiti]]
# [[meat]] of these animals
# short for {{m|fi|hirvieläin}}

